    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just found out i have hyperthyroidism (like my thyroid is overactive) and my doctor started me on some meds for it. but i also take adderall for my adhd. i've been feeling a bit jittery lately and my heart feels like it's racing a little more than usual. is it okay to keep taking my adderall or should i stop? it's making it hard to focus if i don't take it though",
