      "content": "it's not chest pain or anything, just my heart thumping in my chest sometimes when i take it. since you said most people can tolerate it, do you think i should try taking a slightly higher dose of the adderall to help with the brain fog? i feel like if i just get my focus better i might not even notice the jitters as much. just tell me if that sounds like a reasonable way to manage it until my appointment.",
